flowchart TD
    E[Invoice / business event] --> G[Gemini + Google ADK Agent]
    G --> P[Proposed Action]
    P --> A[AgentProof Authorization]
    A --> F[Freshness + Action Binding at Dispatch Seam]
    F -->|blocked| B[BLOCKED Receipt]
    F -->|pass| X[Payment Provider Adapter]
    X --> O[Outcome Verifier]
    O -->|state absent| U[UNVERIFIED Receipt]
    O -->|state proven| V[VERIFIED Evidence Receipt]
    X --> I[Provider Idempotency Index]
    I -->|replay| D[DUPLICATE Receipt]
